### Cadastrar barbeiro

POST http://localhost:3000/barbeiros
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Vanessa Tres",
    "email": "vanessa@barbearia.com",
    "cpf": "666.666.666-44",
    "senha": "senha000"
}

### Buscar barbeiros 

GET http://localhost:3000/barbeiros

### Editar barbeiro

PUT http://localhost:3000/barbeiros/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Vanessa Tres Atualizado",
    "cpf": "666.666.666-44",
    "senha": "novaSenha123"
}

### Deletar barbeiro 

DELETE http://localhost:3000/barbeiros/1

### Cadastrar cliente

POST http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva",
    "cpf": "111.222.333-44",
    "barbeiro_id": 1
}

### Listar clientes

GET http://localhost:3000/clientes

### Cadastrar agendamento

POST http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cliente_id": 1,
    "barbeiro_id": 1,
    "data_hora": "2026-11-25 14:30:00"
}

### Listar agendamentos

GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos

### Editar data do agendamento 

PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamentos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "data_hora": "2026-11-26 16:00:00"
}

### Login do barbeiro 

POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "vanessa@barbearia.com",
    "senha": "senha000"
}